# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/rates — set a grade's rate from a date (body: {grade, pct, from, to, user};
# a blank from applies from the beginning of time; an existing grade and from-date is replaced).
# A blank to has no end. A from or to that is not a date (yyyy-MM-dd), or a to before the from, is
# refused (400). A grade other
# than A, B or C, or a pct that is not a number of 0.00 or more with up to two decimals, is refused
# (400) and nothing is stored. A stored change is recorded in the audit file as RATE_SET; a refused
# one records nothing.
